    "App 不包含广告、数据分析或第三方追踪 SDK，不会出售或共享你的任何数据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app contains no ads, analytics or third-party tracking SDKs, and never sells or shares any of your data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
