    "不用每次手动开始，放大地图就能看到走过的每条街。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No need to press start. Zoom in on the map to see every street you walked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "个人信息": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Personal Info"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "个人资料": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Profile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为了显示地点名称、城市和国家，App 会把停留地点的坐标发送给 Apple 地图服务进行反向地理编码和兴趣点查询。这一过程由 Apple 处理，受 Apple 隐私政策约束，不包含你的身份信息。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To show place names, cities and countries, the app sends the coordinates of places you stay to Apple Maps for reverse geocoding and point-of-interest lookups. Apple handles this under its privacy policy, and no information about who you are is included."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为这段旅程添加照片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add photos to this trip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "之后仍会继续全天自动记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All-day recording will continue afterwards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "之后仍会继续自动记录日常轨迹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everyday tracks will keep being recorded automatically."
