    "周围 300 米内的轨迹和地点不会出现在分享图片和 GPX 文件里，你自己仍然能看到。适合家和其他私人地点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tracks and places within 300 m are left out of shared images and GPX files. You still see everything yourself. Useful for home and other private places."
