    "在“地图”中打开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open in Maps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在“设置”中允许读取“健康”数据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow access to Health data in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在你允许后，App 会在前台和后台读取你的位置，用来画出你走过的路线、识别你停留的地点。手机静止时系统会暂停定位以节省电量。你可以随时在“设置”中关闭自动记录，或在 iOS“设置”中修改定位权限。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your permission, the app reads your location in the foreground and background to draw your routes and recognize the places you stay. When your phone is still, location updates pause to save battery. You can turn off recording in the app's Settings, or change location access in iOS Settings, at any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在地点详情里打开“分享和导出时隐藏这里”即可添加，左滑可以删除。隐私区域内的轨迹不会出现在分享图片和 GPX 文件里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add one by turning on “Hide When Sharing and Exporting” for a place. Swipe left to remove. Tracks inside a privacy zone are left out of shared images and GPX files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在弹出的对话框里选择“更改为始终允许”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose “Change to Always Allow” in the dialog."
          }
        }
      }
    },
