      }
    },
    "所有轨迹、地点、旅程和照片都会从这台设备和你的 iCloud 中永久删除，且无法恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All tracks, places, trips and photos will be permanently deleted from this device and your iCloud. This can't be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手动记录使用更高的定位精度，和全天自动记录互不影响，结束后会保存在“旅程”里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
