    "漫迹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "漫迹在后台安静地记录你每天的轨迹，自动整理去过的地方、城市和国家。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace quietly records your daily routes in the background and organizes the places, cities and countries you visit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "漫迹没有自己的服务器。你的轨迹、到访地点、旅程、照片和备注只保存在你的设备上，并通过你自己的 iCloud 账户在你的设备之间同步。开发者无法看到、访问或导出这些数据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace has no servers of its own. Your tracks, visits, trips, photos and notes are stored only on your devices and synced between them through your own iCloud account. The developer cannot see, access or export this data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "漫迹用你的位置来画出走过的路线、识别停留的地点。位置数据不会离开你的设备和 iCloud。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace uses your location to draw your routes and recognize where you stay. Your location never leaves your devices and iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点一次到访，查看那一天的完整轨迹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a visit to see that day's full tracks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片和备注会被删除，轨迹和地点仍保留在每天的记录里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos and notes will be deleted. Tracks and places stay in your daily records."
          }
        }
      }
    },
