    },
    "精细：路线最贴合街道，耗电更多，适合徒步和骑行爱好者。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detailed: routes follow the streets most closely, using more battery. Great for hikers and cyclists."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统权限弹窗的语言会在下次打开 App 时更新。": {
      "localizations": {
