          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选择“始终允许”后，即使你没有打开 App，轨迹也会被记录下来。系统会在手机静止时自动暂停定位，尽量省电。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With “Always”, your tracks are recorded even when the app isn't open. Location pauses automatically while your phone is still, to save battery."
